# Morrowind diseases caught from a carrier's hits, carried by Skyrim's own creature-disease mechanism: the
# carrier's attacks cast its disease spells (ATKD Attack Spell, as SkeeverRace casts Ataxia) and each disease
# effect rolls fDiseaseXferChance (2.5%) once as it lands. The player (Disease Resist 0, health raised so the
# carrier never kills it) stands beside a placed carrier until the disease lands; `defend` then kills it.
# The blight case also proves a two-effect disease lands whole (the later effects gate on the first).

case disease_contact_common
run
console player.setav health 100000
console player.getav diseaseresist
player->PlaceAtMe "rat_diseased" 1 96 0
until 3000 player->GetCommonDisease == 1
defend
wait 120
end

case disease_contact_blight
run
player->PlaceAtMe "alit_blighted" 1 128 0
until 3000 player->GetBlightDisease == 1
defend
wait 120
end
